{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll inspect the existing verifier, retained inputs and candidate limits, then wire the runtime checks into a per-fixture verifier with red-first tests. I’ll freeze a declaration only if the required limits and their measurement basis are complete before the corpus run."}}
